{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cec3a6a2-9ebd-80e8-ac2b-6048dc6b9f0c",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T12:44:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Patrick Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, happy Monday! How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Beth. Winter youth basketball. Is sign-up still open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull that up. Are you looking to sign up a little one, or a middle schooler?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Grandson. Nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nine, okay, great age for it. Yes, I'm showing registration is still open for the winter session, though spots can fill up, especially after a weekend like this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the nor'easter. Quiet here now though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good. Did you get hit okay, power and everything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Power stayed on. Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:43:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. So for basketball, you can register online through the rec page, or come in and fill out a form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What are the age limits?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's split into age brackets. Generally it starts around first grade and goes up through middle school, so nine fits right in. The league coordinator can tell you which bracket he'd land in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can he call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll leave a message for the coordinator. What's a good number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:27-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one six three, got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Patrick Sullivan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Patrick. Sorry, you sound like you're in a big echoey space. Is it the phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Empty apartment. No furniture yet. Echoes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, that explains it! Well, I can hear you fine. He'll call you back, probably today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thanks, Beth. Have a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:44:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Patrick, enjoy the afternoon!"
    }
  ],
